#   Complete Restatement of the Cybersecurity Law No. XII-1428
#   No. XIII-1299, enacted 2018-06-27, Vilnius
#   Signed by President Dalia Grybauskaitė
#   (No separate effective date stated — Government and MoD
#    adopt implementing legislation per Art. 2)
